        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.jamaicavermont.org/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The West River Railroad was once seen as the salvation for the economic woes of Jamaica and the surrounding valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
