      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamaica%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Jamaica's strategic location near the confluence of the West River and Ball Mountain Brook supported early bridges, dams, and mills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
